        "original_id": "9f12fe7f-134b-58a1-b327-ed7b2e8aba42",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Moon Landing\n- People: Stephen Edwards, Justin Fleming, Buzz Aldrin\n- Events: Apollo 11, American Space Race, Moon landing\n\nFacts:\n- Buzz Aldrin was born Edwin Eugene Aldrin Jr. on January 20, 1930, and he is an American engineer and former astronaut.\n- On July 20, 1969, Apollo 11 landed the first humans on the Moon during the American Space Race.\n- Buzz Aldrin served as the Lunar Module Pilot on Apollo 11 and was one of the first two humans to land on the Moon.\n- Buzz Aldrin was the second person to walk on the Moon.\n- Moon Landing is a musical with book, lyrics, and music by Stephen Edwards.\n- Moon Landing uses an original idea and synopsis by Justin Fleming.\n- Moon Landing is based on the American Space Race and the Apollo 11 spaceflight.\n- Moon Landing presents the story through the eyes of Buzz Aldrin.",
